    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a map-grinding and level-passing game with a top - down perspective as its core gameplay. Players will act as adventurers who collect skill points by grinding monsters and exploring. Use the skill point system to gradually unlock, upgrade skills and strengthen character attributes, and finally challenge high - difficulty levels and bosses. The game combines action combat and map exploration elements. Players need to flexibly use skill combinations to deal with various enemies and unlock levels by completing specific tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Initial Release Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode - Linear map - clearing mode. After the character clears the level, it can be unlocked to the Challenge Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode - Incorporates light Roguelike elements (such as random initial Buff/Debuff, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character System - Three operable characters will be available in the initial release version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7077 AD, the comet &quot;Purple Cloud&quot; tore through the atmosphere, and the strange virus it carried pushed the Earth to the edge of chaos. Humanity eked out a living between the rampaging infected beasts and deformed machines, while the only glimmer of hope was hidden in the guidance of an ancient East Asian proverb - &quot;Where the poison is transported, there must be a solution.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the fun of grinding maps and challenge all kinds of monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has set up multiple map levels, and each map level corresponds to different monsters and skill playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9c891e9f925245ad31fb3729c3399daa.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9c891e9f925245ad31fb3729c3399daa.webm?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9c891e9f925245ad31fb3729c3399daa.mp4?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9afefb646e75480c8bc2a8b6eeafe505.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9afefb646e75480c8bc2a8b6eeafe505.webm?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9afefb646e75480c8bc2a8b6eeafe505.mp4?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Skill Combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a skill tree system. Players can collect various skill points by exploring and defeating enemies. Various skills can be learned by using the corresponding skill points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/5ad1eaf2c2d4797a9c4ef74f84764e0d.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/5ad1eaf2c2d4797a9c4ef74f84764e0d.webm?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/5ad1eaf2c2d4797a9c4ef74f84764e0d.mp4?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/982105ed7207aa0ef71740e5e3ad4b63.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/982105ed7207aa0ef71740e5e3ad4b63.webm?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/982105ed7207aa0ef71740e5e3ad4b63.mp4?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Numerous Boss Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has set numerous bosses. Each boss has different characteristics and skill combinations, and requires strong firepower or skill combinations to be successfully challenged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/62282f32f9f6dfd0b453600e8ed2b5af.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/62282f32f9f6dfd0b453600e8ed2b5af.webm?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/62282f32f9f6dfd0b453600e8ed2b5af.mp4?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a map-grinding and level-passing game with a top - down perspective as its core gameplay. Players will act as adventurers who collect skill points by grinding monsters and exploring. Use the skill point system to gradually unlock, upgrade skills and strengthen character attributes, and finally challenge high - difficulty levels and bosses. The game combines action combat and map exploration elements. Players need to flexibly use skill combinations to deal with various enemies and unlock levels by completing specific tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Initial Release Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode - Linear map - clearing mode. After the character clears the level, it can be unlocked to the Challenge Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode - Incorporates light Roguelike elements (such as random initial Buff/Debuff, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character System - Three operable characters will be available in the initial release version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7077 AD, the comet &quot;Purple Cloud&quot; tore through the atmosphere, and the strange virus it carried pushed the Earth to the edge of chaos. Humanity eked out a living between the rampaging infected beasts and deformed machines, while the only glimmer of hope was hidden in the guidance of an ancient East Asian proverb - &quot;Where the poison is transported, there must be a solution.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the fun of grinding maps and challenge all kinds of monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has set up multiple map levels, and each map level corresponds to different monsters and skill playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9c891e9f925245ad31fb3729c3399daa.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9c891e9f925245ad31fb3729c3399daa.webm?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9c891e9f925245ad31fb3729c3399daa.mp4?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9afefb646e75480c8bc2a8b6eeafe505.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9afefb646e75480c8bc2a8b6eeafe505.webm?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/9afefb646e75480c8bc2a8b6eeafe505.mp4?t=1746366441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Skill Combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a skill tree system. Players can collect various skill points by exploring and defeating enemies. Various skills can be learned by using the corresponding skill points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/5ad1eaf2c2d4797a9c4ef74f84764e0d.poster.avif?t=1746366441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/5ad1eaf2c2d4797a9c4ef74f84764e0d